Modifications in this fork add support for the AL programming language
(Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central):

  - graphify/detect.py        — `.al` registered as a code extension
  - graphify/extract.py       — _AL_CONFIG, extract_al, _al_collect_facts,
                                _resolve_al_facts (AL semantic layer)
  - AL_SUPPORT.md, examples/  — fork documentation and a sample

AL modifications Copyright (c) 2026 the fork authors, released under the same
MIT License as the upstream project.

AL parsing uses tree-sitter-al (https://github.com/SShadowS/tree-sitter-al),
an independent MIT-licensed grammar, consumed as a normal Python dependency
(not redistributed in this repository).
